      "type": "text", "id": "whyfast_body", "x": 620, "y": 662, "width": 560, "height": 82,
      "text": "•  binary protobuf — smaller than JSON text\n•  HTTP/2 multiplexing on one connection\n•  generated stubs — no runtime parsing",
      "originalText": "•  binary protobuf — smaller than JSON text\n•  HTTP/2 multiplexing on one connection\n•  generated stubs — no runtime parsing",
